# /goal

When `/goal` is specified, activate the `modes/goal-mode.md` modifier of `subagent-lane-planner`:
- Run autonomously until all code changes pass automated test/build commands with exit code 0.
- Automatically diagnose and fix test failures and compilation errors.
- Circuit breaker: stop after 3 identical consecutive failures without progress.
